    "notes": [
      "Source ornate open display suitcase, purple flask and white flower paintings are not available. The new gold chest is an explicit display-case proxy; this is not claimed as a matching item drawing.",
      "Three amount medallions use prepared gold-coin and resource glyphs. Their circular ornament detail differs from the source.",
      "Reward footer quantities are observed gem×100 and 24H red bottle×2. The first gold ticket has no reliably readable quantity in this frame; no quantity is invented.",
      "Shop footer keeps independent native text captions inside each of the four destination buttons at 14px. The back chevron is also a separate native caption because deleting the old combined string would otherwise remove it. Original nav pictograms remain omitted.",
      "텍스트 분리를 우선한 v003은 앞선 35행 가이드를 넘을 수 있습니다. 개별 글자가 해당 버튼 부모 안에 있으므로 단일 공백 문자열로 배치하지 않습니다.",
      "v004 artwork-only patch: DisplayCaseProxy → chest. Uses the newly drawn six-cell shop atlas; source item identity and exact original shape are not claimed. Text, quantities, duration, positions, parents, inputs and button behavior are unchanged.",
      "v007 shop-family footer: group420×82 at(0,842), observed Back input40×82 at x0, four destination tabs95×82 at x40/135/230/325. Separate native captions91×38,14px remain within their own tabs. This is not the global five84px-cell navigation specification; no fifth shop destination or relocated Back was invented.",
      "v007 source A92 confirms exactly three claim rewards: gold ticket/card, blue gem×100, red bottle×2 with24H. They are now three separate native image nodes, with gem quantity / bottle duration / bottle quantity as separate native text. The prepared red pilot-ticket is a declared color/illustration proxy for the gold source ticket/card; no quantity is invented for that first reward.",
      "v007 native tab/filter/advance captions are children of their corresponding button, preserving two-part copy/reuse and the correct button input/state ownership.",
      "v008 omits the old whitespace CurrencyValues instruction. No replacement header group is embedded here. Root builds ACE_ShopCurrencyPatch in Limited and then uses normal UI copy/rebind for the other shop families; target-specific visible currencies and values must be rechecked."
    ],
